=== OPEN ISSUE: PA3FWM WebSDR companding table (permission required) ===

sdrstream/_websdr_table.py and go/internal/vocoder/table.go (generated from
it) reproduce a 256-entry sample table taken from the WebSDR HTML5 client
(websdr-sound.js), copyright 2013-2025 PA3FWM (https://www.websdr.org/).

Upstream terms found:
  - The client file header reads "Copyright 2013-2020 ... all rights
    reserved" and allows the code to be made available unmodified, via the
    original WebSDR server software, to original WebSDR clients. Other use,
    including distribution in part, is not covered by that grant.
    (header as quoted in https://goughlui.com/2022/12/05/ ; re-check the live
    file)
  - The WebSDR server documentation states that further distribution and
    reusing parts of the code in other software is not allowed without the
    author's explicit prior permission.
    (dist11/doc/install.txt, e.g. https://github.com/FarnhamSDR/websdr)

